<!--
  Speak now. Capsule, cradle, stem - the mark everyone already knows, so it
  gets no reinvention. The cradle is a half circle rather than a full ring:
  a ring here would read as retry with something stuck in it.
  The capsule is narrow (5 of 24 units) because the wearer sees this one most
  often, mid-utterance, while the footer beside it is changing.
-->
